Drop a photo named after its entry's slug in here, e.g. 2026-09-08.jpg
(matching content/ai-watch/2026-09-08.mdx), and it becomes that entry's
card and hero image automatically — no frontmatter edit needed. Supported
extensions: .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .webp. To use a different filename or share
one image across entries, set `image: "/images/ai-watch/whatever.jpg"` in
the entry's frontmatter instead.
